The '''Magma Cube''' is a hostile [[Mob]] that spawns on the [[Crimson Isle]].

== Spawning ==
=== Crimson Isle ===
{{Lv|151}} Magma Cubes naturally spawn in the {{Zone|Crimson Fields}} on the [[Crimson Isle]].

=== Private Island ===
{{Exclusive/Stranded|method of spawning}}
In {{Gamemode|Stranded}}, {{Lv|151}} '''Magma Cubes''' can spawn naturally in {{Item|Nether Biome Stick|text=Nether Biome}}s.

